        <briefdescription>
<para>Handler for invalidation of the outer IR unit, <computeroutput>IRUnitT</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If the proxy analysis itself is not preserved, we assume that the set of inner IR objects contained in IRUnit may have changed. In this case, we have to call <computeroutput>clear()</computeroutput> on the inner analysis manager, as it may now have stale pointers to its inner IR objects.</para>
<para>Regardless of whether the proxy analysis is marked as preserved, all of the analyses in the inner analysis manager are potentially invalidated based on the set of preserved analyses. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
